<!--
  Reminders and celebrations, the reminder notifications, and the Rhythm card that links to
  them (0.2, behind release.reminders). Verbatim from design v3 (reminders.png,
  reminder-notification.png, today-rhythm.png) where it has the copy, then the handoff, new
  lines per docs/plans/screens/reminders.md.
  Same rules as strings.xml: no backslash escapes, positional format specifiers.

  The notification strings take no format arguments on purpose: a notification is a
  visibility surface, and a fixed string cannot carry a number the policy hides.
-->
